cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying manuscript, please cite both
  the article (preferred citation, below) and this software repository.
title: "AI-driven neuropsychological screening pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a deterministic, rule-based pipeline for
  pre-examination screening in clinical neuropsychology, accompanying the
  manuscript "An AI-Assisted, Rule-Based Pipeline for Pre-Examination
  Screening in Clinical Neuropsychology: An Exploratory Method-Development
  Study". The pipeline integrates five
  validated screening instruments (BIS, Conners CPT-3, Chalder Fatigue
  Scale, HADS, RBANS) into a structured eight-step clinical reasoning chain
  and produces audience-tailored reports for clinical peers, referring
  physicians, and patients. No AI models are invoked at runtime.
